                "text": "Thank you Secretary Lori Chavez-DeRemer for joining the @EdWorkforceCmte. Employer provided health insurance plans are vital to many households across the country. We must ensure the options for employers and employees are high quality and low cost. \n\nListen to my remarks on this with @SecretaryLCD \ud83d\udc47",
