                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The @ThomasMoreSoc is driven by the pursuit for justice.\n\nThey understand why the Chloe Cole Act is so important. It empowers victims. It gives families the chance to demand justice. And it finally holds the medical establishment accountable.\n\nThis would be a true victory - for children, for families, and for America\u2019s future.",
