                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Congratulations to our #MO03 winners of the 2025 @CongressionalAC \n\n\ud83c\udfc6Harish Gandham\n\ud83c\udfc6Sean Sathish\n\ud83c\udfc6Venkata Unnam\n\ud83c\udfc6Jonathon Arul \n\nTheir teams app, MindWell Connect, is a thoughtful, innovative tool designed to make mental-health support more personal and accessible for teens and young adults. I look forward to welcoming them to Washington, D.C. and celebrating this outstanding achievement together!",
